    "updated_at": "2023-05-12T01:57:18Z",
    "body": "Yep, this is a known issue, and \"working as intended\".\r\n\r\nInvestigations into fixing this generally take the form of finding a solution for allowing import maps to update over time. See https://github.com/WICG/import-maps/issues/92, https://github.com/guybedford/import-maps-extensions#lazy-loading-of-import-maps, and https://github.com/guybedford/import-maps-extensions/issues/17 for the latest discussions on how we could do that. We know it's a high-priority request from web developers, but Chromium at least hasn't been able to find the engineering bandwidth for working on it so far.\r\n\r\n/cc @hiroshige-g",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
